     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi-<div><br></div><div>I am using this code to plot box plots and along with the data below it.  Thank you in advance</div><div><br></div><div>Here are my questions:<br></div><div><ul><li><span style=\"line-height:normal\">I want to fill the box plots with specific colors for Group, where 1=red and 3=blue.  How can this be done?</span></li><li><span style=\"line-height:normal\">How can I get open circles for shape? </span></li><li><span style=\"line-height:normal\">How can I display the numerical value for the mean line on the plot?</span></li></ul><div><br></div></div><div><b><font color=\"#0000ff\">ggplot(table, aes(x=Group,y=Value,fill=Group)) + geom_boxplot() + theme_bw() + geom_jitter() + facet_wrap(~ Time)</font></b><br></div><div><b><font color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></b></div><div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"260\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:260pt\">\n\n <colgroup><col width=\"65\" span=\"4\" style=\"width:65pt\">\n </colgroup><tbody><tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" width=\"65\" style=\"height:15.0pt;width:65pt\">Group</td>\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\">Point</td>\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\">Time</td>\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\">Value</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">AAA</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">108</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">24</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">21</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">AAA</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">109</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">24</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">108</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">AAA</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">110</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">24</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">31</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\